/Write a program to display the values from 10 to 0.
Loop,   Load ValueStart
        SkipCond 800        /If AC > 0, is value > 0, skip print 0
        Jump OutputZero
        Output
        Load ValueStart
        Subt One
        Store ValueStart
        Jump Loop

OutputZero,     Output
End,            Halt

ValueStart,     dec 10
One,            dec 1